k; bridge control-plane needs operator tag or bridge_self_admission.\r\n- dispatcher flow: staged planning -\u003e atoms -\u003e frontier; parallel by deps/touch, serial for control-plane/conflicts; self-model read-only compact.\r\n\r\nCRITICAL:\r\n- Core path: scheduler -\u003e supervisor -\u003e server + drivers -\u003e watchdog; keep prompt path fast/read-only.\r\n- Critical modules: driver loop/prompt, memory/context/features, server API.\r\n- main channel is bridge development; bridge PS1 needs BOM, ParseFile, smoke, and commit before DONE.\r\n\r\nMODULES (scanned, not in registry):\r\n- delivery-mode: pure read-only task delivery mode classifier. (fns: Get-DeliveryModeSchema, Normalize-DeliveryPath, Get-DeliveryFactValue)\r\n- self-model: read-only compact Bridge self-model generator (fns: Get-SelfModelBridgeRoot, Read-SelfModelJson, ConvertTo-SelfModelArray)\r\n- decision-contract: Model Decision Layer (SHADOW mode). (fns: Get-DecisionContractSchema, Test-DecisionContract, Get-DecisionShadowPromptHint)\r\n- (+44 more)\r\n\r\nSAFETY:\r\n- Control plane edits are blocked unless operator-approved or admitted by bridge_self_canary gate.\r\n- bridge_self_admission needs bridge scope, trusted source, touch-set, canary, selftest+smoke, rollback.\r\n- Never expose secrets; preserve memory recall; do not create a parallel memory store for self-model.\r\n- PowerShell engine files must be UTF-8 BOM and pass Parser.ParseFile before use.\r\n- Create control/restart.flag only after a verified PS1 diff; never for HTML/docs-only changes.\r\n- Read-only generator must not write registry, state, runtime cache, memory, or project files.\r\n\r\nTESTS:\r\n- Minimum gates: Parser.ParseFile for touched PS1, tools/self_model_smoke.ps1, then smoke.ps1.\r\n- Self-model smoke checks size cap, sections, compact summary, and no source writes.\r\n\r\n","after_turns":119,"after":{"timeout_pct":0.0084,"avg_sec":175.84,"success_pct":0.9748},"hypothesis_ts":"2026-06-08T12:52:51.1667400Z","typ