{"baseline":{"timeout_pct":0.005,"avg_sec":205.6,"success_pct":0.96},"task":"[Автозадача из бэклога] [[NORMAL]] HARDEN UI feed: size-based auto-archive of conversation.jsonl (operator-found 2026-06-10). PROBLEM: the live chat feed grew to 7744 messages because Invoke-ConversationArchive only runs from the UI button or idle housekeeping, and the bridge had no idle all day. Get-Messages -Since 0 (lib/common.ps1) returns the WHOLE file on first page load, so the web UI parsed+rendered 7744 messages -\u003e slow/looked broken. Operator manually archived (7650 moved, 100 kept). FIX (atom, existing mechanism extension - no new subsystem): in the driver maintenance tick (driver/10-maintenance.ps1), when the live conversation.jsonl line count exceeds a threshold (default 1500, config key conversationAutoArchiveLines), call the EXISTING Invoke-ConversationArchive -Keep 200 even when busy - the function is bridge-locked and keeps the hot tail + summary, so agent context is safe by design (see its header comment). Throttle: at most once per 6h. ACCEPTANCE: tools test - a feed file over threshold triggers archive on the maintenance tick and keeps the tail; under threshold does nothing; SelfTest + smoke PASS.","commit":"a76ef4bcf6fa0d608a65668a7ede118cfbed1dc9","type":"hypothesis","ts":"2026-06-10T19:06:36.2487617Z"}
